### Bosqich 4 — Replit IP manzilini aniqlash

Replit da loyihangizni deploy qiling (Deployments → Autoscale yoki Static).

Deploy bo'lgach, terminal ochib shu buyruqni yozing:
```
nslookup yourapp.replit.app
```

Yoki kompyuteringiz terminalida:
```
nslookup amuai.replit.app
